# Allowlist mode: ignore everything by default, track only Transom Core & examples
/*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!Makefile
!CMakeLists.txt
!CMakePresets.json
!src/
!src/**
!include/
!include/**
!examples/
!examples/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**

# Exclude build artifacts, binaries, OS metadata, and non-core example
examples/pdf_inspector.transom
*.o
*.d
*.tbc
*.dylib
*.dll
*.so
*.exe
.DS_Store
